- /start hero: remove misleading 'Free to get started' badge (replaced with
  'Plans from ₦3,200 · Pay with Paystack')
- /start hero: primary CTA now starts the quiz (was a scroll-only button);
  'See how it works' kept as secondary link
- /start hero: clearer pill and subline (no-website, high-review businesses)
- /start: fire Meta standard ViewContent after 10s on intro (engaged visitor)
- /choose-plan: add 'Explore first' skip at top, default tab to lead packs
- analytics: add trackViewContent, ViewContent as Meta standard event,
  plan_skipped now carries position (top|bottom)
